{"meta":{"id":"basic-syntax","category":"it/programming-languages/cpp","title":"기본 문법","subtitle":"(C++)","summary":"변수, 조건문, 반복문, 함수, 클래스 기본 문법","tags":["프로그래밍","c++","기본문법","f-types","f-function","f-class"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-cpp","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>\n      C++\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Programming Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    기본 문법 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-sky-600 font-serif\">(C++)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/60 border border-sky-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 변수, 조건문, 반복문, 함수, 클래스 등 가장 기본적인 문법 요소\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">컴파일 언어</strong>로, 실행 전 g++ 등으로 소스를 기계어로 변환해야 함</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">정적 타입 언어</strong> — 변수를 선언할 때 자료형을 반드시 명시해야 함</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">모든 프로그램은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">int main()</code> 함수에서 실행이 시작됨</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">기본 문법 요소</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">6개 요소</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[24%]\">구분 및 문법</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 w-[38%]\">예시</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[38%]\">설명</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[변수]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">변수 선언</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">int a = 10;</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">자료형 명시 후 변수 선언/초기화</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[조건문]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">if / else</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">if (a &gt; 0) { ... }</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">조건에 따라 분기 실행</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[반복문]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">for</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">for (int i=0;i&lt;10;i++)</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">지정 횟수만큼 반복</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[반복문]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">while</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">while (a &gt; 0) { ... }</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">조건이 참인 동안 반복</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[함수]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">함수 선언</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">int add(int a,int b)</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">반환형, 이름, 매개변수로 구성</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-rose-700 bg-rose-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[클래스]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">클래스 선언</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">class Dog { ... };</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">데이터와 동작을 묶는 객체지향 단위</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">컴파일은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">g++ main.cpp -o main</code> 후 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">./main</code>으로 실행합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">문장 끝에는 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">항상 세미콜론(;)</strong>이 필요합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">표준 라이브러리 기능은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">std::</code> 네임스페이스를 통해 사용합니다. (예: std::cout)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Programming Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>C++</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/programming-languages/cpp/basic-syntax","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"programming-languages","title":"프로그램 언어","path":"it/programming-languages"},{"id":"cpp","title":"C++","path":"it/programming-languages/cpp"}],"hasImage":false}